  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "SequencerClock is a high-precision timing service designed for audio sequencing, utilizing a Web Worker to decouple the critical scheduling loop from the main thread. It manages timing based on BPM and ticksPerBeat, providing sample-accurate timestamps via the AudioContext. Its core function is to schedule future events within a defined lookahead window, ensuring timing stability for rhythm-based applications."
  },
